# Fact patterns — service credits, Acme / Northwind

Generated from `corpus/gold/fact_patterns.jsonl` (FP-009 … FP-016). The monthly service fee
is $20,000 (SYN-003 cover table). `credit_percentage` is still reported when a request is
out of time; `credit` is the payable amount, and it is what the gate zeroes.

> Using Service_credit_acme_northwind as S

## FP-009 — commitment met — no credit (Exhibit A § A.2)

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp009:
  output computation content S.ServiceCredit

scope TestFp009:
  definition computation equals
    output of S.ServiceCredit with {
      -- service_month: |2026-03-01|
      -- monthly_uptime: 99.95
      -- monthly_service_fee: $20,000
      -- request_date: |2026-04-15|
    }
  assertion computation.credit_percentage = 0%
  assertion computation.credit = $0
  assertion computation.eligible = true
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp009
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp009 ─
│ computation =
│   ServiceCredit {
│     -- eligible: true
│     -- credit_percentage: 0.0
│     -- credit: $0.00
│   }
└─
```

