## FP-016 — eligibility gate: request more than 30 days after month end (§ A.4.1)

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp016:
  output computation content S.ServiceCredit

scope TestFp016:
  definition computation equals
    output of S.ServiceCredit with {
      -- service_month: |2026-08-01|
      -- monthly_uptime: 98.7
      -- monthly_service_fee: $20,000
      -- request_date: |2026-10-15|
    }
  assertion computation.credit_percentage = 30%
  assertion computation.credit = $0
  assertion computation.eligible = false
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp016
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp016 ─
│ computation =
│   ServiceCredit {
│     -- eligible: false
│     -- credit_percentage: 0.3
│     -- credit: $0.00
│   }
└─
```
